@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / design method. Native Git/OO/data notation illustration, not a commitment to advanced product features.
title Architecture-to-detailed-design bridge
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

package "01-software-architecture" {
 rectangle "Drivers / options / quality trade-offs" as D
 rectangle "Boundaries / owner contracts" as B
 rectangle "Runtime / deployment / concerns" as R
}
package "02-detailed-and-object-oriented-design" {
 rectangle "01: Shared OO design rules" as P
 rectangle "05: Safe evolution and debt method" as E
}
package "03-component-and-module-design" {
 rectangle "Specific interfaces / classes / algorithms\nTechnical scenarios / coding constraints" as C
}
D --> P : rationale
B --> P : ownership
R --> C : constraints
P --> C : refine
E --> C : assess and evolve
C ..> B : feedback: explicit architecture decision if boundary changes

@enduml
